ください。髪、乾かしてあげますね。\n\n【髪を乾かしている途中、後輩くんが安心して眠くなり、ゆっくりあなたの胸に倒れ込む】\n\nん？ もう眠くなってきましたか？\nそれなら今夜は、このまま私の腕の中でゆっくり休んでください。\n\n……いつも本当にお疲れさまです。\n今夜はもう何も考えなくていいですから、このままゆっくり眠ってくださいね。\n\nおやすみなさい。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kurosaki_aoin/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2028683686477271040%2FA4qxchCD.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=63f44cdce123d706b17628255c3205ba", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2028683686477271040%2FA4qxchCD.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=63f44cdce123d706b17628255c3205ba, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2028683686477271040%2FA4qxchCD.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1c89815e862d7a5cfadab913ad2199d5 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2028683686477271040%2FA4qxchCD.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6f6ef68e8cce16ca7a2f38527066a312 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "voice", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3818373, "client_id": 6530, "nc": 176}, {"path": "/@kurosaki_aoin/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2028683686477271040%2FA4qxchCD.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&